  CardSpriteHand: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 156de14cf9889c14c94271ab25d3e1ec, type: 3}
  Placement: 2
  CardStory: "I don\u2019t witness the incident, but 2Club tells me of it in the
    mess hall. I haven\u2019t seen her as much lately, and I miss her. *I let her
    know so that she is aware of it being a product of busyness, not lack of care.*\r\n\r\nWhy
    did 2Spade phrase it like that? Still, she seems to understand. There is not
    much joking around, even with her. Not anymore. *People eat mechanically, finish
    their food and stand to leave back to their post. Duty is important.*\r\n\r\nMeals
    at this post were never a cheerful affair, but there is tension in the air. She
    is afraid too, as many others. *Five people have been chewing for a while without
    taking a bite.* \r\n\r\nInsubordination is unthinkable. Now more than ever."
